      "isolated_pin_label|1016000|673100|8810c901-d8c5-400e-87c1-b8d6fcb76e74|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000": "RGB output not implemented -> LED part not selected, no safe-state pull and no load yet. Beta scope: expander pin reserved only.",
      "isolated_pin_label|1016000|698500|314cf88c-f676-42c5-b889-f4119f56808a|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000": "RGB output not implemented -> LED part not selected, no safe-state pull and no load yet. Beta scope: expander pin reserved only.",
      "isolated_pin_label|1016000|723900|ab4c33d4-99a0-4771-9302-516d25899834|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000": "RGB output not implemented -> LED part not selected, no safe-state pull and no load yet. Beta scope: expander pin reserved only.",
      "isolated_pin_label|1130300|660400|3c534a06-53bb-46bc-9b5b-e5678ca66dab|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000": "Beta deferred: U7 Ebyte E07-400M10S pin 21 ANT intentionally parked; antenna is on the module IPEX port and all module RF is DO NOT ROUTE.",
      "isolated_pin_label|1193800|1231900|7e7837ac-6975-4aa2-80e0-b2e39379b439|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000": "Beta deferred: ST25R3916-AQET AAT_A (antenna auto-tuning A) network intentionally parked until the NFC RF/matching review; no external network is captured yet. DO NOT ROUTE.",
