      "isolated_pin_label|1193800|1358900|a0832ccb-e6a2-4ed8-88a2-607d920b1d67|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000": "Beta deferred: ST25R3916-AQET RFI2 (RF receiver in 2) network intentionally parked until the NFC RF/matching review; no external network is captured yet. DO NOT ROUTE.",
      "isolated_pin_label|1193800|1409700|82d349ff-3e3c-4fe0-a931-7dcc6558c2b2|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000": "Beta deferred: ST25R3916-AQET CSI (capacitive-sensor input) network intentionally parked until the NFC RF/matching review; no external network is captured yet. DO NOT ROUTE.",
      "isolated_pin_label|1193800|1485900|f8fc8579-79e1-4685-8d93-37f7009cdb87|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000": "Beta deferred: ST25R3916-AQET MCU_CLK (clock output) network intentionally parked until the NFC RF/matching review; no external network is captured yet. DO NOT ROUTE.",
      "isolated_pin_label|1600200|1257300|3496c504-ce06-4b47-af2d-a23f135672e0|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000": "reverse-polarity topology parked -> post-Kickstarter power review; BAT_CONNECTOR_P/BAT_PROTECTED_P intentionally distinct. DO NOT ROUTE.",
      "isolated_pin_label|2146300|711200|4ba0d5c0-86af-4111-92e5-283b1be4e596|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000": "Beta deferred: J2 Molex 5025700893 mechanical card-detect captured as a named net but intentionally unrouted -- no Beta GPIO allocated; awaiting a pin-map revision or a formal decision to drop the feature. DO NOT ROUTE.",
