      "label_dangling|1092200|571500|d0c3c9f7-aec1-4967-999d-760b67d144eb|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000": "Beta deferred: U7 Ebyte E07-400M10S RF net intentionally parked until the RF review; certified module keeps its front end internal. DO NOT ROUTE.",
      "label_dangling|1562100|1447800|c6557e58-892b-4be7-94ea-ef407b92ae3a|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000": "Intentionally reserved: former XGPIO14 community-header pin, retained as RESERVED_NC after U61 P16 was reclaimed as SX1262_RXEN; deliberately unconnected so the header pinout below XGPIO13 does not shift. DO NOT ROUTE.",
      "label_dangling|2413000|635000|05d7c383-469e-4456-9b4d-abb779ef0f48|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000": "Beta deferred: U8 Ebyte E22-900M22S RF net intentionally parked until the RF review; certified module keeps its front end internal. DO NOT ROUTE.",
      "label_dangling|3530600|1917700|b51e085d-e1b4-4611-9b0b-dbc1dde98fb9|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000": "RootProbe Phase 2 placeholder -> connector, pin count and mechanical format not locked, no footprint. DO NOT ROUTE.",
      "label_dangling|622300|1054100|63dfcc03-faf5-4067-8778-7763e28012cc|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000": "reverse-polarity topology parked -> post-Kickstarter power review; BAT_CONNECTOR_P/BAT_PROTECTED_P intentionally distinct. DO NOT ROUTE.",
