      "pin_to_pin|1041400|812800|b3d48b15-1a70-49b1-96b4-e2c8b674085a|60a66239-11df-4a6f-817b-38f3f6844702": "BMI270 unused auxiliary interface pin tied to VDDIO per datasheet; bidirectional symbol type retained intentionally.",
